.git

# Built in the image. A host node_modules is worse than useless here: pnpm's
# layout carries platform-specific binaries, and an up-to-date one would make
# `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` a no-op and leave them in place.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.docusaurus
embedg-service/embedg-server
embedg-service/embedg-service
